# One line ending, everywhere (2026-09-11). Git already stored every text file
# as LF — core.autocrlf converted on add — but Windows checkouts got CRLF, so the
# bytes a Windows session read and wrote were not the bytes CI tested. CLAUDE.md
# Rule 10 records what that cost. Pinned here rather than per machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe mis-parses labels and `goto` in a batch file with LF endings.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
